@baseUrl = http://localhost:5140

### List seeded products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Create an order (command returns Id, TotalPrice, ExpectedDeliveryAt)
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "productId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Get the created order (query reads the same shared model)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json
